{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】香港國際棍網球六人賽，下月11至13日在黃竹坑遊樂場舉行。</p>\n<p>來自5個國家及地區10支男、女子隊參賽，男子組除了兩支港隊代表、國家隊及日本球隊之外，還有首次來港參與六人賽的越南棍網球隊，以及俄羅斯莫斯科棍網球會。</p>\n<p>女子組同樣有兩支港隊代表，加上國家隊及莫斯科球會，4隊角逐。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T09:56:09.460477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:24:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:32.318890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T09:49:32.318890+00:00","content_hash":"32258b80fbcdf88da4d52c44e56bfc2f2af2a924abc0f39403ae0c08edeed2ee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}